# Python
#
# The packaging directories are anchored with a leading slash on purpose. Unanchored,
# `lib/` matches at any depth and silently swallows `web/src/lib/` - the API client and the
# shared types - which is a broken checkout that looks fine locally.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
/build/
/develop-eggs/
/dist/
/downloads/
/eggs/
/.eggs/
/lib/
/lib64/
/parts/
/sdist/
/var/
/wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

